WEBVTT

00:18:29.163 --> 00:18:31.621
this is a kind of magic, if you will.

00:18:31.621 --> 00:18:37.954
This is a kind of portal that that I guess
I've been longing to enter for

00:18:37.954 --> 00:18:43.746
a long time. Another piece of this that
goes way back is always as a young child,

00:18:43.746 --> 00:18:48.329
I always wanted to know what was happening
inside of other people's minds.

00:18:48.329 --> 00:18:51.663
Like really like what did they really feel
? What did they really think?

00:18:52.413 --> 00:18:55.538
What was their actual experience
of being human?

00:18:55.829 --> 00:18:58.413
And so in this book, I was like, wow,

00:18:58.413 --> 00:19:01.496
I've finally been let in
to that to that secret.